	(text_box "- PCM1808 has 20ns rise/fall times for DATA. BCLK and LRCLK outputs. \n- At 150mm/ns speed, transmission line effects shouldn't be relevant here.\n- @{\"Id\":\"ZNUQKOY~{F}GZRWSAUK\",\"ObjectType\":2} @{\"Id\":\"ZNUQKOY~{F}MBVTETUG\",\"ObjectType\":2} @{\"Id\":\"ZNUQKOY~{F}MXOSCORG\",\"ObjectType\":2} series resistors are optional and intended to be RC filters (with parasitic capacitance) for removing some high-frequency content from the signals if needed. The bare rise times are much faster than needed\n- PCM1808 output load capacitance = 20pF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.24 97.79 0)
